# {{ .RenderedProviderName }} Provider

Manages [Convex](https://convex.dev) projects, deployments and their
configuration as code.

Use it to provision projects and cloud deployments, issue deploy keys, attach
custom domains, set environment variables, and stream logs to an external
destination.

